    transliteration: "Maṇṇā maṇiyiṉ mācaṟak kaḻīi,\niṭumpai nilaiyiṉai eñcātu niṉṟu,\niRuñcāṉ taṇinta arumpeṟal mārpiṉ,\nNeñcu tiṟa nuval vanta niṉ moḻi\nKēṭṭaliṉ iṉiya — iṉṉēyāṉ vāḻavēṉ!\nKuṟiñci pāṭi, kaṇṇam kaitoḻa,\nKāmar vēṅkaik kāntaḷ nāṟum\nKāṭu uṭai nāṭaṟku uraittaṉai — tōḻī!",
