    english: "The kāñci bloomed along the paddy fence;\none tank — one lotus — one heron;\none home — one heart — was waiting;\n'Come' no one said — anyone;\none husband came — from one direction;\n'Come' says — his own heart;\none direction — one path — the courtesan's house;\none home — one grief — even now!",
