    altTranslation: "The kōṅku bloomed on the mountain;\nthe rains came — fragrance spreading;\none woman — one eye — one smile;\none night — one moon — one mountain;\none embrace — one feeling — one word;\none I — one you — one world;\none, one, always one —\nthe gods — shall always know!",
