    transliteration: "Malai maḻai kōṅku — kār kālam;\nVēṅkai vaṇṭu moykum;\nVantāṉ — mīṇṭum — oru maṉam;\nOru kaṇṇi koṇṭu — oru kai nīṭṭiṉāṉ;\nOru nakai kāṭṭiṉāṉ — oru moḻi coṉṉāṉ;\nOru neñcu tantāṉ — oru ulaku kaṭṭiṉāṉ;\nMīṇṭum mīṇṭum varuvāṉ — orē;\nOru kātal — orē — eṉṟum!",
