    altTranslation: "Summer wasteland — again and again;\none tree's shade — again and again;\nmullai fragrance — again and again;\nmemory of the heroine — again and again;\nlike a yāḻ in the heart — again and again;\nthe rains will come — again;\none road I will return — again;\none life, one love — again!",
