    altTranslation: "The summer road — like a sea — I crossed;\none tree's shade — cool water;\nmullai fragrance — like a sea — spreading;\nmemory of the heroine — like a sea — deep;\nlike a yāḻ — like a sea — in the heart;\nthe rains will come — I will return — like a sea;\none home, one girl — like a sea;\none life — like a sea — of love!",
