    english: "Summer road — one day — I walked;\none tree's shade — one cool spring;\nmullai fragrance — on the wind — arrived;\nmemory of the heroine — filled the heart;\nthe rains will come — I will return — certainly;\none home — one girl — one love;\nlike a yāḻ — like a sea — like a mountain;\none life, one love — always!",
