    altTranslation: "Summer road — one day — I walked;\none tree's shade — one cool spring;\nmullai fragrance — on the wind — came;\nmemory of the heroine — filled my heart;\nthe rains will come — I will return — certain;\none home — one girl — one love;\nlike a yāḻ — like a sea — like a mountain;\none life, one love — always!",
