    english: "Rain-mountain kōṅku — the rains;\none woman, one eye, one world;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — with you — will endure;\nagain and again — anew — with you;\none love — yāḻ, sea, mountain — all;\none night — one mountain — with you;\none I, one you — with you — will endure;\nthe gods — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with you!",
