    english: "The kōṅku on the mountain — the rains;\nthe bee-filled vēṅkai fragrance;\none beloved — with you — yāḻ, sea, mountain;\nhe who never turns away — with you — always;\nagain and again — anew — with you;\none marriage, one life — now;\none you, one me — with you;\none word — now — yāḻ, sea, mountain!",
