    transliteration: "Maḻai malai kōṅku kār;\nOru peṇ — yāḻ kaṭal malai — eṉṉōṭu;\nOru kaṇ — yāḻ kaṭal malai — āḻam;\nOru kural — yāḻ kaṭal malai — oli;\nOru neñcu — yāḻ kaṭal malai — uṟuti;\nOru nāṉ — yāḻ kaṭal malai — avaḷōṭu;\nOru nī — yāḻ kaṭal malai — eṉṉōṭu;\nOru kātal — yāḻ kaṭal malai — eṉṟum!",
    english: "Rain-mountain kōṅku — the rains;\none woman — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with me;\none eye — yāḻ, sea, mountain — deep;\none voice — yāḻ, sea, mountain — sound;\none heart — yāḻ, sea, mountain — firm;\none I — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with her;\none you — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with me;\none love — yāḻ, sea, mountain — always!",
