    altTranslation: "Rain-mountain kōṅku — the rains;\none woman — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with me;\none eye — yāḻ, sea, mountain — deep;\none voice — yāḻ, sea, mountain — sound;\none heart — yāḻ, sea, mountain — firm;\none I — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with her;\none you — yāḻ, sea, mountain — with me;\none love — yāḻ, sea, mountain — always!",
