    english: "The rains came — mullai bloomed;\none way — I returned;\nthe heroine — one house — one doorway;\none face — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — she;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — I;\none life — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey;\none love — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey!",
