    transliteration: "Kuṉṟattil kōṅku kār;\nVaṇṭu moykum — niṉaivu — tēṉ;\nYāḻ kaṭal malai — niṉaivu — vāḻvu — avaṉ;\nMīṇṭum mīṇṭum — niṉaivu — putiṭāy;\nOru tirumpal illāṉ — niṉaivu — eṉṟum;\nOru maṇam oru vāḻvu — niṉaivu;\nOru nī — niṉaivu — vāḻvu — ippōtu;\nOru col — niṉaivu — vāḻvu — yāḻ kaṭal malai — tēṉ!",
    english: "The kōṅku on the mountain — the rains;\nbees swarming — memory — honey;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — memory — life — he;\nagain and again — memory — anew;\nhe who never turns away — memory — always;\none marriage, one life — memory;\none you — memory — life — now;\none word — memory — life — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey!",
