    english: "The sea — joy — life — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey;\none heron, one neyttal;\none ship — joy — life — came;\none friend — joy — life — came;\nagain and again — joy — life — anew;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — joy — will endure;\none love — joy — life — memory — yāḻ, sea, mountain;\none I, one you — always — joy — life — one!",
