    altTranslation: "The sea — joy — life — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey;\none heron, one neyttal;\none ship — joy — life — came;\none friend — joy — life — came;\nagain and again — joy — life — anew;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — joy — will endure;\none love — joy — life — memory — yāḻ, sea, mountain;\none I, one you — always — joy — life — one!",
    note: "One I, one you, always, joy, life, one. The neytal shore has moved from pure longing to this declaration of joy. The sea that was the space of waiting is now joy-life-yāḻ-sea-mountain-honey. Every arrival is joy and life; every reunion is memory renewed; every moment on this shore is part of the one love that is always one."
