    transliteration: "Curam kaṭantāṉ — makiḻvu — vāḻvu — niṉaivu;\nOru vākku — tirumpi varuvēṉ — tantāṉ;\nOru makiḻvu — niṉaivu — vāḻvāy — kāttirrukkum;\nKār varum — tirumpuvāṉ — yāḻ kaṭal malai;\nOru kai kāli — malai pōl — tāṅkukirēṉ;\nOru mārpu kuḷirntatu — kaṭal pōl — kāttirrukkum;\nMakiḻvu vāḻvu niṉaivu — eṉṉōṭu — ippōtum;\nOru vāḻvu — makiḻvu — niṉaivu — yāḻ kaṭal malai — tēṉ!",
    english: "He crossed the wasteland — joy — life — memory;\none promise — I will return — he gave;\none joy — memory — as life — waits;\nthe rains will come — he will return — yāḻ, sea, mountain;\none hand empty — like a mountain — I endure;\none chest grown cold — like a sea — it waits;\njoy, life, memory — with me — even now;\none life — joy — memory — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey!",
