    note: "The earlier image of the empty hand and cold chest (poems 83, 113, 343) returns — but now the heroine endures like a mountain and waits like a sea. The three-metaphor framework has given her a way to understand her own capacity for endurance. She endures with mountain-strength; she waits with sea-depth. Joy, life, and memory are with her even now, even in the emptiness."
