    transliteration: "Kaḻaṉi vayal — muṭivillā — viḷaintatu;\nTāmarai taṭam — muṭivillā — malarntatu;\nOru neñcu — muṭivillā — kātttatu;\nOru kaṇavaṉ — muṭivillā — illai;\nOru maṉai — muṭivillā — kasappu;\nOru peṇ — muṭivillā — makiḻvu — vāḻvu — nēṟmai;\nKaṉavum nampikkayum — muṭivillā — eṉṟum;\nYāḻ kaṭal malai — tēṉ — muṭivillā — orē!",
    english: "The paddy-field — endless — ripened;\nthe lotus tank — endless — bloomed;\none heart — endless — waited;\none husband — endless — not there;\none house — endless — bitterness;\none woman — endless — joy — life — integrity;\ndream and hope — endless — always;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — endless — one!",
