    transliteration: "Kār vantatu — iṟuti muṟai;\nMullai malarntatu — kaṭaici kōṭai;\nOru vaḻi tirumpiṉēṉ — muṭivillā — makiḻvoṭu;\nTalaivi — oru vīṭu — oru vāyil;\nOru mukam — muṭivillā — makiḻvu — vāḻvu — niṉaivu;\nYāḻ kaṭal malai — tēṉ — muṭivillā — avaḷ — eṉṉōṭu;\nOru vāḻvu — muṭivillā — makiḻvu — niṉaivu;\nOru kātal — muṭivillā — eṉṟum — orē!",
    english: "The rains came — final time;\nmullai bloomed — last summer;\none way I returned — endless — with joy;\nthe heroine — one house — one doorway;\none face — endless — joy — life — memory;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — endless — she — with me;\none life — endless — joy — memory;\none love — endless — always — one!",
