    english: "The kōṅku on the mountain — last rains;\nbees swarming — endless — honey;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — endless — joy — life — memory;\nhe who never turns away — endless — with you;\nagain and again — endless — anew;\none marriage, one life — endless — now;\none you — endless — joy — life — now;\none word — endless — yāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — always!",
