    transliteration: "Kaḻaṉi vayal — muṭivillā — viḷaintatu;\nTāmarai taṭam — muṭivillā — āḻam;\nOru neñcu — muṭivillā — kātttatu;\nOru kaṇavaṉ — muṭivillā — illai;\nOru maṉai — muṭivillā — taṉimai;\nOru peṇ — muṭivillā — makiḻvu — vāḻvu — niṉaivu — nēṟmai;\nKaṉavum nampikkayum — muṭivillā;\nYāḻ kaṭal malai — tēṉ — muṭivillā — eṉṟum — orē!",
    english: "The paddy-field — endless — ripened;\nthe lotus tank — endless — deep;\none heart — endless — waited;\none husband — endless — not there;\none house — endless — solitude;\none woman — endless — joy — life — memory — integrity;\ndream and hope — endless;\nyāḻ, sea, mountain — honey — endless — always — one!",
